WEBVTT

00:02.270 --> 00:06.270
These are your orders,
my divinely unified subjects!

00:06.940 --> 00:10.820
Defend this dimension with your lives!

00:11.820 --> 00:16.530
Defend our world from the menace of the Nights!

00:16.530 --> 00:19.120
Th-There's way too many of them!

00:24.620 --> 00:27.630
Stand your ground, everyone!

00:27.630 --> 00:30.210
We need to hang on until the time is right!

00:53.900 --> 00:56.700
The Nights are disappearing?

00:57.950 --> 01:00.870
You closed the Gate, didn't you?

01:02.200 --> 01:04.870
Thank you so much.

02:38.220 --> 02:40.640
<i>Yo, everyone! Yuma here.</i>

02:40.640 --> 02:43.300
<i>I may have made my debut as an exorcist girl,</i>

02:43.300 --> 02:46.890
<i>but I still had to take my finals afterwards, and those were a battle of their own!</i>

02:46.890 --> 02:51.350
But thanks to Luciela-sensei,
I managed to survive them!

02:54.730 --> 02:58.280
<i>Finally, my long-awaited
summer break has begun!</i>

02:59.740 --> 03:02.910
Toi-san, it's the ocean! I spy the ocean!

03:02.910 --> 03:03.770
Yeah!

03:04.120 --> 03:06.620
Hey, Luciela-sensei, when you see the ocean,

03:06.620 --> 03:09.330
don't you get so excited you just can't keep it in?

03:09.330 --> 03:11.330
I feel like that right now!

03:13.210 --> 03:14.300
Wonderful!

03:14.300 --> 03:15.000
Ow!

03:16.380 --> 03:18.630
You're such a positive person, Yuma-san.

03:18.630 --> 03:20.760
Yeah! I get that all the time!

03:26.680 --> 03:27.850
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

03:28.390 --> 03:30.730
<i>I'm sorry I made you worry.</i>

03:31.850 --> 03:34.730
<i>Look after Matoi for me.</i>

03:36.480 --> 03:38.190
<i>I'm sorry, Shiori.</i>

03:39.320 --> 03:41.780
<i>I'm a failure as a father.</i>

03:42.860 --> 03:45.830
The Sea, the Hot Springs,
and the Sometimes Evil Spirits.

03:54.380 --> 03:56.610
Woohoo!

03:58.300 --> 03:59.590
Take that!

03:59.590 --> 04:00.880
Hey!

04:40.000 --> 04:42.130
Aren't you going to play with them?

04:42.130 --> 04:43.800
I don't have the energy for that.

04:44.510 --> 04:47.210
If we're on vacation, I want to act like it's one.

04:47.850 --> 04:51.180
You were the one who planned this trip, right?

04:51.180 --> 04:52.560
Why did you choose to take us here?

04:53.390 --> 04:55.390
I was looking for somewhere accessible by car,

04:55.390 --> 04:57.690
where we can keep our expenses minimal.

04:58.270 --> 05:02.190
Then how about our friends over at Tenkai Shrine?

05:03.030 --> 05:06.490
It's close to the ocean, and there's a
boarding house all the monks sleep at.

05:06.490 --> 05:08.800
They'll feed you, and there's even a hot spring!

05:09.410 --> 05:12.910
And if I talk to them,
you can stay for damn near free.

05:13.330 --> 05:14.700
Really?

05:15.250 --> 05:17.380
If you wouldn't mind, I'd be <i>very</i> grateful.

05:18.290 --> 05:19.840
I'd be delighted to!

05:20.420 --> 05:22.130
And that's how it happened.

05:22.130 --> 05:25.400
Is that really the only reason
you chose this place?

05:26.010 --> 05:27.340
What do you mean?

05:27.640 --> 05:32.310
You're a cold, calculating woman.
Always after something.

05:33.220 --> 05:34.890
What a terrible thing to say.

05:35.980 --> 05:39.560
Even <i>I </i>want to do things for other people sometimes.

05:40.270 --> 05:43.070
Well, I'm still grateful for all of this, of course.

05:43.990 --> 05:47.370
Oh, another question.
Why'd you invite Poochi?

05:47.370 --> 05:48.610
Tezuka-san?

05:48.610 --> 05:50.160
I didn't.

05:50.830 --> 05:53.660
Didn't you invite him, Sergeant?

05:53.660 --> 05:55.660
Why <i>would</i> I?

05:57.370 --> 05:58.580
Then...

05:59.000 --> 06:01.040
why is he here?

06:01.710 --> 06:05.260
It's only been two weeks
since the last Night appeared,

06:05.640 --> 06:06.970
but they're awfully carefree.

06:09.300 --> 06:10.220
What is it?

06:10.890 --> 06:12.100
Nothing.

06:12.100 --> 06:15.180
Clarie-san! I knew you'd come!

06:15.180 --> 06:16.680
C-Clarie-san?

06:16.680 --> 06:20.940
Oh, who cares! We're like two peas in a pod, battling demons together!

06:20.940 --> 06:24.280
Stop standing around
and come have fun with us!

06:24.280 --> 06:25.780
N-No, I'll just—

06:25.780 --> 06:27.320
It's fine, it's fine.

06:27.320 --> 06:28.320
H-Hey!

06:28.320 --> 06:29.820
Don't worry!

06:29.820 --> 06:33.700
I thought you might come too,
so I packed you a swimsuit just in case!

06:33.700 --> 06:35.200
That's not the problem.

06:35.200 --> 06:38.620
Hey, you can stay the night at the shrine with us too!

06:38.620 --> 06:40.500
Don't just make plans for me!

06:40.500 --> 06:42.840
Oh, calm down! It's fine!

06:43.380 --> 06:45.050
Ta-da!

06:45.340 --> 06:47.050
Uh, you're...

06:47.050 --> 06:48.670
Clarus, a.k.a. Clarie!

06:48.670 --> 06:50.680
Don't introduce me weirdly.

06:52.090 --> 06:54.560
Society is so unbalanced.

06:56.680 --> 06:57.430
Tezuka-san?

06:57.890 --> 07:01.690
A blonde MILF and a blonde schoolgirl!

07:01.690 --> 07:04.360
It's like I've got my dream harem!

07:04.360 --> 07:06.480
It's a blessing to be alive right now!

07:06.480 --> 07:07.610
Tezuka-san...

07:07.860 --> 07:12.160
I don't think you're the one at the center of that harem.

07:12.160 --> 07:14.030
I never realized he was this brain-dead.

07:14.030 --> 07:17.160
Clary-san, let's have a blast!

07:17.160 --> 07:18.120
I—

07:18.120 --> 07:20.370
I mean, we're at the beach, right?

07:20.370 --> 07:23.200
Me too! I wanna blast with you girls!

07:23.200 --> 07:25.250
You're staying here.

07:25.250 --> 07:27.250
Why would I stay here?

07:27.250 --> 07:29.260
I'm going for a little stroll.

07:29.260 --> 07:30.800
Look after our gear.

07:30.800 --> 07:33.340
But that's not fair!

07:33.340 --> 07:35.680
Well, I'll live.

07:35.680 --> 07:37.890
After all, Luciela-san and I'll be all—

07:38.600 --> 07:39.100
Huh?

07:39.520 --> 07:41.980
She's gone!

07:41.980 --> 07:43.050
Ah, I'm sorry!

07:45.820 --> 07:48.280
I don't have any. Should I do a few jumping jacks?

07:47.020 --> 07:48.280
Shingo-san...

07:48.650 --> 07:50.780
Toi-san? Is something wrong?

07:50.780 --> 07:53.490
I'm sorry! I'm really sorry!

07:51.110 --> 07:52.110
Huh?

07:52.110 --> 07:54.490
Oh, it's nothing.

08:01.160 --> 08:02.600
The IATO?

08:02.960 --> 08:04.540
What do you want?

08:04.540 --> 08:07.750
Do you know anything about  Tenkai Shrine?

08:09.300 --> 08:11.170
It appears you don't.

08:12.010 --> 08:14.050
Tenkai Shrine was Sumeragi Matoi's...

08:17.220 --> 08:18.720
What do you think?

08:18.720 --> 08:21.020
Should I tell Matoi?

08:22.270 --> 08:25.400
I see. So that's why you chose this place.

08:25.730 --> 08:29.070
But why are you telling me this?

08:29.070 --> 08:32.950
I thought it would be best
if we shared information.

08:32.950 --> 08:37.990
It's possible bringing them here
might cause something to happen.

08:39.330 --> 08:40.240
Farewell.

08:40.240 --> 08:41.080
Wait.

08:42.290 --> 08:45.540
Is that the IATO's official consensus?

08:45.540 --> 08:46.500
Of course not.

08:54.680 --> 08:56.830
<i>Why? How?</i>

08:56.830 --> 08:59.310
<i>Just by shaving ice down and putting syrup on it?</i>

08:59.310 --> 09:01.270
<i>But it's just water!</i>

09:01.850 --> 09:02.850
<i>This must be...</i>

09:03.520 --> 09:04.690
Cool Japan!

09:04.690 --> 09:05.850
No, it's not.

09:08.940 --> 09:11.500
No one's coming back...

09:20.830 --> 09:23.160
This is Tenkai Shrine, huh?

09:23.160 --> 09:27.170
It's dedicated to the god of the sea!

09:27.170 --> 09:28.920
Pretty big, eh?

09:28.920 --> 09:29.750
It is.

09:30.040 --> 09:31.050
Excuse me.

09:31.050 --> 09:33.960
Are you the group from Tenman Shrine?

09:33.960 --> 09:36.050
Ah, yes we are.

09:36.590 --> 09:39.930
My name is Amane Yayoi.

09:39.930 --> 09:42.180
Unfortunately, the chief priest is out,

09:42.180 --> 09:46.000
so I'll be looking after all of you in their place.

09:46.520 --> 09:48.020
It's nice to meet you.

09:48.400 --> 09:50.440
Thank you for your courtesy.

09:50.440 --> 09:52.360
It's nice to meet you as well.

09:52.360 --> 09:54.900
I'm Tezuka Hideo.

09:54.900 --> 09:56.150
Please call me Poochi!

09:57.200 --> 09:58.420
<i>I think she likes me!</i>

09:58.420 --> 09:59.780
Shingo-kun!

10:01.830 --> 10:03.660
What!?

10:04.870 --> 10:06.750
Wh-What are you...

10:06.750 --> 10:09.500
Don't you remember me?

10:09.500 --> 10:10.750
It's Yayoi!

10:10.750 --> 10:12.250
Amane Yayoi!

10:12.550 --> 10:13.460
Eh?

10:13.460 --> 10:15.700
Yayoi-san?

10:16.260 --> 10:20.220
Little Yayoi? You've gotten big!

10:20.220 --> 10:23.260
Heck, you're a grown-up now, aren't you?

10:23.260 --> 10:26.890
I was in middle school
when we first met, after all.

10:26.890 --> 10:28.980
Um, Shingo-san...

10:28.980 --> 10:31.020
Oh, right. This is—

10:31.020 --> 10:33.690
Is this your daughter?

10:34.020 --> 10:35.500
Huh? Ah, yes.

10:35.940 --> 10:37.900
My name is Sumeragi Matoi.

10:37.900 --> 10:39.320
I knew it!

10:39.320 --> 10:42.430
I can really see Shiori-sama in your eyes.

10:42.700 --> 10:44.540
"Shiori-sama"?

10:46.000 --> 10:47.200
<i>Could it be...</i>

10:47.200 --> 10:49.420
Your mother!

10:49.920 --> 10:56.010
Your mother took me under her wing and taught me how to be a shrine maiden.

10:56.710 --> 10:59.470
My mom was a shrine maiden?

11:02.050 --> 11:04.140
And she lived at this shrine?

11:08.680 --> 11:12.440
Ahh, this is heaven!

11:12.440 --> 11:16.900
Man, dinner was delish, and the
hot springs are just as great. Eh, Clarie-san?

11:17.440 --> 11:18.400
Hot springs...

11:19.990 --> 11:21.360
Where's the shower?

11:25.950 --> 11:27.620
<i>Shingo-san...</i>

11:27.620 --> 11:33.080
<i>I wonder why Shingo never told me mom was a Shrine maiden here.</i>

11:34.580 --> 11:38.500
<i>Maybe it hurt him too much to even bring her up.</i>

11:40.840 --> 11:43.300
Of course this happens before I could decide to tell her.

11:44.370 --> 11:45.650
Just a little higher!

11:45.180 --> 11:47.180
You lookin' to get arrested, Poochi?

11:47.510 --> 11:48.770
You're terrible, Shin-kun!

11:48.770 --> 11:53.900
As a police officer, I'm ensuring their safety by checking the wall so <i>you</i> can't spy on them!

11:53.900 --> 11:55.310
Is that so...

11:56.060 --> 11:58.650
And unfortunately, this wall is flawless!

11:58.650 --> 12:02.200
You're so lucky you can relax.

12:03.660 --> 12:04.160
Oh!

12:06.450 --> 12:07.620
Matoi-san.

12:08.080 --> 12:10.500
Did you enjoy our hot springs?

12:10.500 --> 12:13.250
Yes. They were very nice.

12:13.250 --> 12:15.210
I'm glad to hear it.

12:15.210 --> 12:17.590
I've gone ahead and laid out a futon for you in your room,

12:17.590 --> 12:19.420
so have a good night's rest.

12:19.420 --> 12:21.130
U-Um...

12:21.130 --> 12:22.090
What is it?

12:22.800 --> 12:24.760
I want to ask about my mom.

12:25.930 --> 12:29.900
My mom, what kind of life did she lead here at this shrine?

12:31.100 --> 12:32.430
I'd be happy to tell you.

12:33.980 --> 12:39.860
I first met your mother when I came here to be trained as a shrine maiden.

12:39.860 --> 12:43.320
I was just about your age, actually.

12:44.200 --> 12:48.410
Your mother did a wonderful job as a maiden of this shrine.

12:49.240 --> 12:53.040
She was bright, lively,
and treated everyone the same.

12:53.790 --> 12:57.880
She was the perfect shrine maiden to me.

12:57.880 --> 12:59.670
I see.

12:59.670 --> 13:01.750
I only knew her for a little while,

13:01.750 --> 13:04.760
but I learned so much from your mother.

13:05.430 --> 13:08.060
She taught me how I should act,

13:08.060 --> 13:10.000
she made sure I was prepared,

13:10.500 --> 13:13.560
and she showed me how to live.

13:13.620 --> 13:16.480
I'm maiden at this shrine
because of your mother.

13:16.480 --> 13:19.650
My mom must have been pretty amazing.

13:19.650 --> 13:21.690
Yes, she really was.

13:22.360 --> 13:25.000
When did she meet Shingo-san?

13:25.490 --> 13:28.490
She was living here then, wasn't she?

13:30.910 --> 13:34.620
I think you should ask your father about that.

13:35.660 --> 13:38.500
Those are memories that are precious to him.

13:39.170 --> 13:39.960
Okay.

13:39.960 --> 13:41.290
Toi-san!

13:41.290 --> 13:43.460
There you are!

13:43.460 --> 13:45.130
What is it, Yuma-chan?

13:45.130 --> 13:47.220
We're doing a test of courage!

13:47.220 --> 13:49.140
Huh? A test of courage?

13:49.140 --> 13:55.180
The rock wall nearby's a hot spot for ghosts!

13:55.180 --> 13:56.560
Ain't that right, Clarie-san?

13:56.560 --> 13:57.350
No idea.

13:57.350 --> 14:01.890
Let's go grab the rest of the gang and head out.

14:01.890 --> 14:07.150
B-But I don't want to go anywhere haunted!

14:04.280 --> 14:07.900
It's a test of courage, a courage test!

14:07.150 --> 14:09.360
Listen to me!

14:07.900 --> 14:10.950
Test of courage, courage test!

14:11.280 --> 14:13.450
So, what's a "test of courage"?

14:15.700 --> 14:20.830
So, let's get this test of courage started!
I'm your host, Yuma.

14:21.330 --> 14:26.670
Pair up with whoever matches your stick,
and then we'll go in order along the rock wall.

14:26.670 --> 14:30.380
There's even a rope bridge and stuff!
I rate it spoopy out of ten.

14:30.380 --> 14:32.010
Go ahead and draw.

14:34.850 --> 14:36.970
Luciela-sensei pulled Pair C,

14:36.970 --> 14:39.230
and Clarie-san pulled Pair B.

14:39.480 --> 14:42.360
Excuse me! Can I pick next?

14:42.360 --> 14:43.510
Go for it.

14:44.480 --> 14:48.650
<i>The blonde MILF's got C,
or the blonde girl's got B!</i>

14:48.650 --> 14:49.860
<i>C or B.</i>

14:51.820 --> 14:57.040
<i>Lord, give me strength!</i>

14:59.210 --> 15:01.170
This is the worst possible outcome!

15:01.670 --> 15:03.500
You're telling me.

15:04.290 --> 15:09.380
Well, I can't see them anymore,
so Toi-san and Clarie-san, you're up next.

15:09.380 --> 15:11.260
Go on!

15:11.260 --> 15:13.640
W-We're really doing this?

15:13.640 --> 15:14.890
Duh!

15:15.140 --> 15:16.890
B-But...

15:16.890 --> 15:19.140
Why are you so afraid?

15:19.140 --> 15:21.060
You battle Nights.

15:21.060 --> 15:23.440
This is different!

15:23.440 --> 15:24.110
I see.

15:27.360 --> 15:30.570
W-Wait! Don't leave me behind!

15:30.570 --> 15:32.410
Hey, you'll make me sweat! Let go!

15:32.410 --> 15:34.190
I-I can't!

15:34.190 --> 15:35.240
Even if you can't, let go!

15:35.240 --> 15:36.370
No! I don't wanna!

15:36.370 --> 15:37.490
You're making it hard to walk.

15:37.490 --> 15:39.580
But Clarus-san...

15:38.410 --> 15:40.870
Nice reaction, Toi-san!

15:40.870 --> 15:44.580
I knew it was worth planning this!

15:44.580 --> 15:46.880
You really like this kind of stuff, don't you, Yuma-san?

15:47.170 --> 15:52.220
My motto is "Enjoy life to the fullest!"

15:52.220 --> 15:54.590
I see. You most are certainly are.

15:55.890 --> 15:57.930
You know, Shin-kun,

15:58.430 --> 16:01.520
this place has got quite the atmosphere, huh?

16:02.810 --> 16:04.100
Get off me, Poochi.

16:04.100 --> 16:06.480
Not only is it annoying, I can't breathe.

16:06.480 --> 16:10.840
Y-You say that, but you know you'll comfort your dear subordinate when he's scared—

16:13.030 --> 16:15.310
Don't be so mean, Shin-kun!

16:15.310 --> 16:16.910
I didn't do anything.

16:17.240 --> 16:19.070
Then what...

16:24.420 --> 16:26.040
That expression...

16:26.040 --> 16:27.920
It's the same one Shimizu and Kasai had.

16:28.540 --> 16:30.460
Poochi, are you hurt?

16:30.460 --> 16:33.050
Y-You mean, besides the heart-attack?

16:33.050 --> 16:35.340
If you can joke, you're fine.

16:35.340 --> 16:37.010
Keep an eye on this bastard.

16:37.010 --> 16:39.010
I'm going to get Matoi and
the others out of here.

16:39.010 --> 16:40.220
What?

16:40.220 --> 16:43.810
Come back! Don't leave me here!

16:44.560 --> 16:49.360
C-Clarus-san, did you hear something like a scream just now?

16:49.360 --> 16:50.820
I did.

16:50.820 --> 16:54.200
Other people are doing
the same thing we are, after all.

16:54.610 --> 16:57.320
How can you be this calm?

16:57.320 --> 16:59.830
I was trained to be.

17:00.990 --> 17:02.580
To defeat the Nights?

17:03.200 --> 17:04.710
What other reason would there be?

17:09.200 --> 17:11.870
Calm down, it's me, Shingo!

17:09.380 --> 17:13.460
Demons begone, demons begone! Go away!

17:13.460 --> 17:15.220
Huh? Shingo-san?

17:15.220 --> 17:18.510
Y-You scared me! Don't do that—

17:18.510 --> 17:19.890
Hurry back to the shrine.

17:20.300 --> 17:22.890
Tell the others when you see them.

17:23.720 --> 17:25.310
Did something happen?

17:25.310 --> 17:26.640
Another incident.

17:26.980 --> 17:28.980
Are you listening to me? Go straight back.

17:28.980 --> 17:30.770
Stay away this time.

17:31.520 --> 17:33.530
O-Okay.

17:33.530 --> 17:35.230
Good girl. I'm trusting you.

17:35.530 --> 17:36.900
Shingo-san...

17:36.900 --> 17:39.400
I'll be all right. I'm a cop.

17:41.620 --> 17:42.700
It's me.

17:43.200 --> 17:45.910
Clarus. A Gate of Caelum just opened.

17:45.910 --> 17:47.290
The Nights!

17:48.000 --> 17:49.330
Shingo-san!

17:51.340 --> 17:52.500
Are you coming?

17:54.010 --> 17:55.550
I-I...

17:55.920 --> 17:57.840
<i>Stay away this time.</i>

17:58.130 --> 18:00.390
<i>Thank God you're safe.</i>

18:00.930 --> 18:02.260
I...

18:02.260 --> 18:04.350
That's fine.

18:04.350 --> 18:05.850
Leave it to me.

18:06.350 --> 18:07.390
Come!

18:07.390 --> 18:10.230
System halt. Status: unconfined.

18:10.690 --> 18:11.810
Divine Union!

18:14.150 --> 18:17.150
Dimensional Transformation: Level 3.

18:18.700 --> 18:19.950
Clarus-san...

18:19.950 --> 18:21.070
I know.

18:21.070 --> 18:24.200
I'll keep your family safe.

18:25.950 --> 18:27.160
Toi-san?

18:27.460 --> 18:28.620
Matoi-san?

18:28.620 --> 18:29.920
Let's go back, Yuma-chan.

18:29.920 --> 18:31.750
You too, Luciela-sensei.

18:31.750 --> 18:34.050
What's wrong, Toi-san?

18:34.050 --> 18:35.380
Where's Clarie-san?

18:35.380 --> 18:37.050
Don't worry about her! Let's go back!

18:37.050 --> 18:38.220
It can't be.

18:39.720 --> 18:41.340
A DR reaction?

18:41.340 --> 18:42.600
There's a Night this close?

18:43.050 --> 18:44.890
A demon came out?

18:44.890 --> 18:46.060
Come on, Yuma-chan! Let's go back!

18:46.520 --> 18:48.020
What are you saying?

18:48.020 --> 18:50.940
If there's a demon, we have to exorcise it!

18:52.860 --> 18:58.110
Sh-Shingo-san told me to stay away this time.

18:58.820 --> 18:59.750
Poochi!

19:00.320 --> 19:02.280
He told me he was trusting me.

19:03.160 --> 19:04.830
I'm going to protect Matoi.

19:04.830 --> 19:06.200
I'm going to keep my promise.

19:06.450 --> 19:07.880
I'm a cop...

19:08.120 --> 19:09.160
I...

19:09.360 --> 19:10.580
and a father!

19:10.880 --> 19:13.100
I don't want him to worry about me.

19:16.170 --> 19:18.300
I get how you feel.

19:18.760 --> 19:21.590
But I'm an exorcist girl now.

19:22.970 --> 19:24.850
That's why I'm going!

19:25.930 --> 19:27.390
Yuma-chan!

19:34.440 --> 19:35.940
It's just absorbing my attack!

19:40.190 --> 19:40.690
Here it comes!

19:40.690 --> 19:42.830
Take this!

19:44.200 --> 19:45.280
You little...

19:48.870 --> 19:51.620
My attack isn't working!

19:55.840 --> 19:57.920
I'll send it to a higher dimension!

20:07.350 --> 20:08.060
Get back!

20:08.060 --> 20:09.720
You're not getting rid of me that easily!

20:11.930 --> 20:13.770
It can't be!

20:13.770 --> 20:15.560
I'll use my strongest attack, then!

20:22.030 --> 20:23.900
Quaedum Fulmen!

20:45.510 --> 20:47.200
Clarie-san!

20:51.600 --> 20:52.600
Matoi-san.

20:53.600 --> 20:55.100
I...

20:56.520 --> 20:57.350
What was that?

20:57.350 --> 20:58.480
What?

21:01.440 --> 21:03.070
A-At this rate...

21:03.320 --> 21:06.400
...we'll end up as demon kibble!

21:15.750 --> 21:16.830
What...

21:16.830 --> 21:18.210
...is that?

21:18.210 --> 21:19.400
Shingo-san!

21:49.950 --> 21:52.120
It defeated the Night in one attack?

21:52.120 --> 21:54.000
Amazing.

21:54.370 --> 21:55.450
Shingo-san!

21:55.450 --> 21:57.290
Hang on!

21:58.580 --> 22:00.040
Toi-san!

22:00.580 --> 22:01.680
Don't worry.

22:01.680 --> 22:04.920
He's unconscious, but breathing.

22:06.880 --> 22:08.400
Thank God.

22:08.930 --> 22:10.550
I'm glad he's safe.

22:15.140 --> 22:19.300
If anything had happened to him,
I wouldn't be able to face...

22:20.340 --> 22:21.730
...Shiori-sama.

22:22.520 --> 22:24.900
Yayoi-san?

22:26.660 --> 22:28.820
Feeling your heart

22:28.820 --> 22:37.580
hito wa umarenagara hikari to kage wo

22:28.820 --> 22:37.580
It's natural for us all to be followed

22:37.580 --> 22:43.590
matoi tsuzukeru

22:37.580 --> 22:43.590
by light and shadow

22:43.590 --> 22:47.090
The lonely one

22:49.260 --> 22:51.300
Feeling your heart

22:51.300 --> 23:00.020
You can obtain all you've ever wanted

22:51.350 --> 23:00.060
hoshii mono subete te ni ireru koto

23:00.020 --> 23:06.280
sore ga shiawase nano

23:00.020 --> 23:06.280
But is that truly happiness?

23:06.280 --> 23:11.240
darekaga egao nara

23:06.280 --> 23:11.240
If someone is smiling,

23:11.240 --> 23:17.750
dokokade kitto naiteru hito ga ite

23:11.240 --> 23:17.750
somewhere, someone else is probably crying

23:17.750 --> 23:23.960
surechigau hodo itooshiku omou

23:17.750 --> 23:23.960
As our paths continue to cross,

23:23.960 --> 23:28.760
kimochi ga aru

23:23.960 --> 23:28.760
our love grows stronger

23:28.760 --> 23:33.760
hitotoki no aida ni

23:28.760 --> 23:33.760
In that short span of time

23:33.760 --> 23:40.270
bokura wa minna mujun wo dakishimete

23:33.760 --> 23:40.270
we embrace all contradictions

23:40.270 --> 23:48.400
as we watch the lights that lead us to tomorrow

23:40.310 --> 23:48.450
ashita e no hikari wo mitsume nagara

23:48.400 --> 23:53.580
aruiteku no kana

23:48.400 --> 23:53.580
I wonder if we'll keep walking this path

23:56.580 --> 24:00.040
Shingo-san tells me how he feels about Mother,

24:00.040 --> 24:02.460
and how he feels about me.

24:02.460 --> 24:05.300
Those feelings are the same
as what I wished for.

24:05.830 --> 24:08.090
Next time, "A Small Wish."

24:08.090 --> 24:10.960
I'm going to be a shrine maiden of Divine Union!
